cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated paper."
title: "Spectral-Two-Asset-Knockout: geometry-adapted spectral pricing of two-asset knockout options"
abstract: >-
  Spectral eigenfunction pricing of two-asset European knockout options under
  constant-coefficient Black-Scholes dynamics, with Fourier-Galerkin, Bessel and
  Mathieu bases, finite-difference and Monte Carlo benchmarks, and the validation
  scripts and stored results behind the tables and figures of the associated paper.
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-15
